            </contributor>
            <creation xml:id="creation_7b57f233">
               <date isodate="1870" xml:id="date_N20474">1870</date>
            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_01af15e0">
               <p xml:id="idm265">Hartmann composed his tune to the text by Carl Andersen in 1870. It was printed for the first time in <rend xml:id="idm266" fontstyle="italic">Illustreret Tidende </rend>on 1 January 1871. In 1878 the chaplain of Vor Frue Kirke, Jakob Paulli, wrote a new text, "Jert Hus skal I bygge", for the wedding of his brother. It was printed with Hartmann's tune in <rend xml:id="idm267" fontstyle="italic">IIllustreret Tidende</rend> on 20 June 1880.</p>
            </history>
